---
title: Should I write a test?
---
flowchart TD
    A([New code]) --> B{Is it logic?}
    B -->|yes| C{Is it hard to get right?}
    B -->|no| D[Skip the test]
    C -->|yes| E[Write a unit test]
    C -->|no| F{Did it break before?}
    F -->|yes| E
    F -->|no| D
    E --> G[(CI)]
    subgraph Review
        G --> H[Code review]
    end
    D --> H
